## RF-04 / RF-03 phase and delay
  RO4835 LoPro 4 mil over L2    : 5 deg = 41 um; residual <= 5 deg across 60.3-63.8 GHz after a single-frequency cal needs delay match <= 7.9 ps = 1.45 mm; design target 2 ps = 0.36 mm
  RO4835 4 mil + RO4450F 4 mil o: 5 deg = 40 um; residual <= 5 deg across 60.3-63.8 GHz after a single-frequency cal needs delay match <= 7.9 ps = 1.41 mm; design target 2 ps = 0.36 mm
  via fence pitch lambda_g/8: 4 mil 0.37 mm, 8 mil 0.36 mm

