  worst 33 ms window: on <= 4.8 ms -> off >= 28.20 ms; minus a <2 ms fragment -> > 26.20 ms >= 25.5 ms (margin 0.70 ms). Max burst for 25.5 ms off with 2 ms fragments excluded: 5.5 ms

