  TJ at 50 C ambient, RthJA 22.3 C/W (JEDEC 2S2P), 1.3 W -> 79 C (limit 105 C)
  1.0 V buck ripple current: (5-1)*(1/5)/(0.47 uH * 4 MHz) = 0.43 A p-p

